{"viewport_w": 1280, "slide_w_in": 13.333, "slide_h_in": 7.5, "slides": [{"img": "s1.jpg", "links": [], "edits": [{"id": "0:0-0-1", "x": 100, "y": 240.203125, "w": 429.890625, "h": 121.796875, "fs": 52, "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)", "ff": "Lato, sans-serif", "fw": "700", "ta": "start", "italic": false, "text": "Évaluer les risques professionnels"}, {"id": "0:0-0-2", "x": 100, "y": 381.796875, "w": 465.421875, "h": 96, "fs": 20, "color": "rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85)", "ff": "Lato, sans-serif", "fw": "400", "ta": "start", "italic": false, "text": "Transformez votre DUERP en outil de pilotage vivant, connecté à vos accidents réels.\nRéduisez votre sinistralité et maîtrisez vos cotisations AT/MP."}]}, {"img": "s2.jpg", "links": [], "edits": [{"id": "1:0-0-0", "x": 100, "y": 89.1875, "w": 498.328125, "h": 157.59375, "fs": 44, "color": "rgb(15, 23, 42)", "ff": "Lato, sans-serif", "fw": "700", "ta": "left", "italic": false, "text": "Le DUERP n'est pas une formalité. C'est ce qui fait baisser vos accidents."}, {"id": "1:0-0-1", "x": 100, "y": 285.578125, "w": 472.875, "h": 78.78125, "fs": 17, "color": "rgb(107, 114, 128)", "ff": "Lato, sans-serif", "fw": "400", "ta": "left", "italic": false, "text": "La plupart des organisations remplissent le DUERP pour cocher l'obligation, puis le classent. Pourtant, c'est le seul document qui transforme vos risques en prévention concrète."}, {"id": "1:0-0-2", "x": 100, "y": 394.25, "w": 507.125, "h": 49.890625, "fs": 17, "color": "rgb(107, 114, 128)", "ff": "Lato, sans-serif", "fw": "400", "ta": "left", "italic": false, "text": "Un DUERP figé ne réduit aucun accident. Votre service de santé au travail suit vos visites médicales, mais ne fait pas vivre votre DUERP."}, {"id": "1:0-0-3", "x": 100, "y": 475.03125, "w": 499.375, "h": 83.1875, "fs": 18, "color": "rgb(0, 69, 109)", "ff": "Lato, sans-serif", "fw": "500", "ta": "left", "italic": false, "text": "Chez Ayming, nous croyons qu'un DUERP ne vaut que s'il est vivant : c'est ce qui fait baisser vos accidents, pas le fait de l'avoir rempli."}, {"id": "1:0-1-0-1", "x": 866.703125, "y": 189, "w": 330.296875, "h": 17, "fs": 14.011355874316939, "color": "rgb(15, 23, 42)", "ff": "Lato, sans-serif", "fw": "600", "ta": "start", "italic": false, "text": "15,6%\ndes établissements transmettent leur DUERP"}, {"id": "1:0-1-0-2", "x": 723, "y": 463, "w": 193.703125, "h": 17, "fs": 13.981929347826087, "color": "rgb(15, 23, 42)", "ff": "Lato, sans-serif", "fw": "600", "ta": "start", "italic": false, "text": "40 ans\nde conservation exigée"}]}, {"img": "s3.jpg", "links": [], "edits": [{"id": "2:0-0", "x": 203.90625, "y": 85.421875, "w": 912.1875, "h": 104.796875, "fs": 44, "color": "rgb(15, 23, 42)", "ff": "Lato, sans-serif", "fw": "700", "ta": "center", "italic": false, "text": "Comment les organisations gèrent leur DUERP aujourd'hui"}, {"id": "2:0-1-0-1", "x": 163.859375, "y": 465.015625, "w": 232.265625, "h": 22, "fs": 18, "color": "rgb(13, 164, 232)", "ff": "Lato, sans-serif", "fw": "600", "ta": "center", "italic": false, "text": "Le DUERP figé (Word / Excel)"}, {"id": "2:0-1-0-2", "x": 114.5625, "y": 501.015625, "w": 330.859375, "h": 61.78125, "fs": 14, "color": "rgb(107, 114, 128)", "ff": "Lato, sans-serif", "fw": "400", "ta": "center", "italic": false, "text": "Rempli une fois, jamais rouvert. Le DUERP existe mais reste un document mort, déconnecté des accidents réels et sans plan d'action suivi."}, {"id": "2:0-1-1-1", "x": 513.40625, "y": 465.015625, "w": 293.171875, "h": 22, "fs": 18, "color": "rgb(13, 164, 232)", "ff": "Lato, sans-serif", "fw": "600", "ta": "center", "italic": false, "text": "Le logiciel de conformité déconnecté"}, {"id": "2:0-1-1-2", "x": 498.765625, "y": 501.015625, "w": 322.453125, "h": 84.171875, "fs": 14, "color": "rgb(107, 114, 128)", "ff": "Lato, sans-serif", "fw": "400", "ta": "center", "italic": false, "text": "Un outil, pas une réduction du risque. Plateforme QHSE en self-service, qui historise et coche des cases mais ignore vos accidents réels et n'agit pas à votre place."}, {"id": "2:0-1-2-1", "x": 961.78125, "y": 465.015625, "w": 156.4375, "h": 22, "fs": 18, "color": "rgb(13, 164, 232)", "ff": "Lato, sans-serif", "fw": "600", "ta": "center", "italic": false, "text": "Le cabinet ponctuel"}, {"id": "2:0-1-2-2", "x": 880.203125, "y": 501.015625, "w": 319.59375, "h": 61.78125, "fs": 14, "color": "rgb(107, 114, 128)", "ff": "Lato, sans-serif", "fw": "400", "ta": "center", "italic": false, "text": "Un livrable, puis le silence. Un consultant révise le DUERP une fois. Le document est propre le jour de la remise, figé six mois plus tard."}]}, {"img": "s4.jpg", "links": [], "edits": [{"id": "3:0-0", "x": 100.703125, "y": 121, "w": 1118.578125, "h": 104.796875, "fs": 44, "color": "rgb(15, 23, 42)", "ff": "Lato, sans-serif", "fw": "700", "ta": "center", "italic": false, "text": "Dans un monde idéal, voici ce que serait le pilotage de vos risques professionnels"}, {"id": "3:0-1-0-1", "x": 142.421875, "y": 460.59375, "w": 172.65625, "h": 18, "fs": 14.970930232558139, "color": "rgb(13, 164, 232)", "ff": "Lato, sans-serif", "fw": "600", "ta": "center", "italic": false, "text": "Un DUERP toujours à jour"}, {"id": "3:0-1-0-2", "x": 101.15625, "y": 492.59375, "w": 255.171875, "h": 36.796875, "fs": 12.974806201550388, "color": "rgb(107, 114, 128)", "ff": "Lato, sans-serif", "fw": "400", "ta": "center", "italic": false, "text": "L'évaluation reflète la réalité du terrain en continu, pas une photo annuelle vite périmée."}, {"id": "3:0-1-1-1", "x": 432.390625, "y": 460.59375, "w": 167.703125, "h": 18, "fs": 14.970930232558139, "color": "rgb(13, 164, 232)", "ff": "Lato, sans-serif", "fw": "600", "ta": "center", "italic": false, "text": "Connecté à vos accidents"}, {"id": "3:0-1-1-2", "x": 402.5, "y": 492.59375, "w": 227.5, "h": 57.59375, "fs": 12.974806201550388, "color": "rgb(107, 114, 128)", "ff": "Lato, sans-serif", "fw": "400", "ta": "center", "italic": false, "text": "Les risques qui causent vraiment vos accidents sont identifiés et priorisés, pas noyés dans une liste générique."}, {"id": "3:0-1-2-1", "x": 712.84375, "y": 460.59375, "w": 181.796875, "h": 18, "fs": 14.970930232558139, "color": "rgb(13, 164, 232)", "ff": "Lato, sans-serif", "fw": "600", "ta": "center", "italic": false, "text": "Un plan d'action qui avance"}, {"id": "3:0-1-2-2", "x": 687.328125, "y": 492.59375, "w": 232.84375, "h": 57.59375, "fs": 12.974806201550388, "color": "rgb(107, 114, 128)", "ff": "Lato, sans-serif", "fw": "400", "ta": "center", "italic": false, "text": "Les actions de prévention sont priorisées, suivies et tenues, pas oubliées dans un classeur."}, {"id": "3:0-1-3-1", "x": 1006.15625, "y": 460.59375, "w": 170.1875, "h": 18, "fs": 14.970930232558139, "color": "rgb(13, 164, 232)", "ff": "Lato, sans-serif", "fw": "600", "ta": "center", "italic": false, "text": "Une sinistralité qui baisse"}, {"id": "3:0-1-3-2", "x": 968.765625, "y": 492.59375, "w": 244.953125, "h": 57.59375, "fs": 12.974806201550388, "color": "rgb(107, 114, 128)", "ff": "Lato, sans-serif", "fw": "400", "ta": "center", "italic": false, "text": "Moins d'accidents, un coût AT/MP qui se maîtrise, une prévention qui se voit dans les chiffres."}]}, {"img": "s5.jpg", "links": [], "edits": [{"id": "4:0-0-2-0", "x": 452.90625, "y": 208.109375, "w": 414.171875, "h": 100, "fs": 42, "color": "rgb(15, 23, 42)", "ff": "Lato, sans-serif", "fw": "700", "ta": "center", "italic": false, "text": "Piloter le DUERP et les risques professionnels"}, {"id": "4:0-0-3-0-0", "x": 187.46875, "y": 378.109375, "w": 120.390625, "h": 57, "fs": 47.98986486486486, "color": "rgb(13, 164, 232)", "ff": "Lato, sans-serif", "fw": "700", "ta": "center", "italic": false, "text": "4,5 M"}, {"id": "4:0-0-3-0-1", "x": 173.6875, "y": 439.109375, "w": 147.96875, "h": 15, "fs": 11.997466216216216, "color": "rgb(107, 114, 128)", "ff": "Lato, sans-serif", "fw": "600", "ta": "center", "italic": false, "text": "DE SALARIÉS COUVERTS"}, {"id": "4:0-0-3-1-0", "x": 482